{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06355","headline":"九月九日刘十八东堂集 · 李颀","name":"九月九日刘十八东堂集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风俗尚九日，此情安可忘。\n菊花辟恶酒，汤饼茱萸香。\n云入授衣假，风吹闲宇凉。\n主人尽欢意，林景昼微茫。\n清切晚砧动，东西归鸟行。\n淹留怅爲别，日醉秋云光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}